"formSearchBox\" action=\"browse.aspx\" method=\"get\">\r\n          <TABLE borderColor=\"#ccffcc\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"2\" width=\"200\" border=\"1\">\r\n            <TR>\r\n              <TD>\r\n                <span id=\"ucEfloraHeader_lblSearchBox\"><INPUT TYPE='Hidden' NAME='flora_id' ' id='flora_id' VALUE='5' >\n&nbsp;<input id=name_str name=name_str &nbsp;  value=''  class=small title='Use % as the wildcard\r\n(e.g. pinus % or pinus a%)'  onfocus='jsClearTextBox(this);' accessKey=s size=15> <input class=small type=submit value=Search name=btnSearch><br>\n <input name=chkAllFloras type=checkbox   > <span class=small>All Floras &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<A HREF='search_page.aspx?flora_id=5'  TARGET='_top'  class='a.link.small'>Advanced Search</A></span>\n</span></TD>\r\n            </TR>\r\n          </TABLE>\r\n        </FORM> <!-- end of search box -->\r\n      \r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    </TD>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdSubHeader\">\r\n<table id=\"FooterTableOut\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <TD>\r\n      <table bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" id=\"footerTable\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"WIDTH: 291px\"> Page 225</td>\r\n          <TD align=\"right\">\r\n            <span id=\"ucEfloraSubHeader_lblLinks\"><a target='_top' href='/login.aspx'>Login</a>\n | <A HREF='/index.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >eFloras Home</A> | <A HREF='/help_page.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >Help</A></span></TD>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </TD>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdBody\">\r\n          <table id=\"tableBody\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td id=\"tdLeftBar\" valign=\"top\" width=\"0\"></td>\r\n\r\n              <td id=\"tdContent\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"1930\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td vAlign=\"top\">\r\n                      <table id=\"tableTaxonChain\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<td><span id=\"lblTaxonChain\"><font size=\"2\"><A HREF='flora_page.aspx?flora_id=5'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='Flora homepage' >Pakistan</A> | <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=5'  TARGET='_top' >Family List</A> | <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=20426'  TARGET='_top' >Labiatae</A> <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=5&start_taxon_id=20426'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' ><img border='0' src='images/layout/icon-list.gif'></A> | <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=135332'  TARGET='_top' >Ziziphora</A> <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=5&start_taxon_id=135332'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' ><img border='0' src='images/layout/icon-list.gif'></A></font></span></td>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <div id=\"panelTaxonTreatment\">\r\n\t\r\n                        <span id=\"lblTaxonDesc\"><!-- Default Template -->\r\n1. <b>Ziziphora clinopodioides</b> Lam., Illustr. Gen.  1: 63.  1791.  Benth. in DC., Prodr. 12: 117. 18 Boiss., Fl. Or. 4: 585. 1879; Burkill, Work. List Fl. Pl. Baluch. 60. 1909; Mukerjee in Rec. Bot. Surv. Ind. 14, 1: 117. 1940; Hedge in Notes Roy. Bet. Gard. Edinb. 23: 215. 1961; Stewart, Ann. Cat. Vasc. Pl. W. Pak. & Kashm. 638. 1972; Rech. f., Fl. Iran. 150: 481. 1982; Tuljaganova in Vvedensky, Conspect. Fl. As. Med. 9: 156. 1987.  \r\n<P>\r\nI.C. Hedge\r\n<P>\r\n<Image:Begin>\r\n<TABLE cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"4\" width=\"200\" align=\"right\" bgColor=\"#ffffcc\" border=\"1\" >\r\n<TR>\r\n  <TD>\r\n    <A HREF='object_page.aspx?object_id=117324&flora_id=5' ><IMG SRC='http://www.mobot.org/mobot/PakistanImages/192-Labiatae/Ziziphora_clinopodioides.jpg' \n\twidth=200 border=0 >\n</A><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250090615'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='Treatment' >Ziziphora clinopodioides</A><br>\nIllustration<p align='right'>\n<SMALL class='font-color:purple'>Credit: M. Rafiq</SMALL>\n<br>\n\r\n  </TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n</TABLE>\r\n<Image:End>\r\n<P>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nSuffruticose perennial, much branched. Stems decumbent, ascending to erect, 5-30 cm, ± glabrous, pilose to villous. Leaves elliptic to lanceolate, 10-15 x 2-5 mm, glandular punctate below, ± glabrous to pilose. Inflorescence terminal, ovate-globose, c. 15-20 x 15-20 mm, ± glabrous to vinous, c. 14-30-flowered. Upper cauline leaves transitional into bracts. Calyx 5-6 mm, narrow tubular with short ± connivent linear-lanceolate teeth, ± glabrous to densely villous. Corolla white, pink to mauve, 8-11 mm; tube included within calyx in male-sterile flowers, shortly exserted in hermaphrodite flowers. Nutlets pale brown.<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDescribed from Siberia (? type in P). <p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nThe extreme polymorphism of this species (s.l.) throughout SW Asia is well-known. In Pakistan, unlike other areas, the variation is relatively limited and only two variants are recognized here. Although I have followed Rechinger’s <i>Flora Iranica</i> treatment by recognizing two subspecies in our area, this stems more from convenience than a belief in the reality of two discrete taxa (cf. Hedge, 1961 and Rechinger, 1982). It would be a very suitable species for biosystematic and field studies by local botanists.<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<P>\r\n</span>\r\n                        <P><!-- Key -->\r\n                        <div id=\"panelKey\">\r\n\t\t\r\n                          <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                          <table id=\"tableKey\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD width=\"347\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyTitle\"><b><font size=\"2\"></font></b></span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD nowrap=\"nowrap\" align=\"right\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyEditLink\"><font size=\"1\"></font></span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#f1ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD colspan=\"2\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyDesc\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></P>\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKey\"><TABLE  WIDTH='100%' BORDER='0' >\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-1'>1</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Calyx indumentum ± densely white villous; stems ± erect</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>1 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250090616'  TARGET='_top' >Ziziphora clinopodioides subsp. pseudodasyantha</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Calyx indumentums sparsely pilose; stems ascending</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>1 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250090618'  TARGET='_top' >Ziziphora clinopodioides subsp. afghanica</A></td>\n</TR>\n</TABLE>\n</span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD colspan=\"2\">\r\n                                <span id=\"lblKeyList\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\r\n                        \r\n\t</div></P> \r\n                        <P>\r\n                          <span id=\"lblLowerTaxonList\"><p>\n<B>Lower Taxa</B><br>\n<ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250090618' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Ziziphora</b> <b>clinopodioides</b> subsp. <b>afghanica</b>  (Rech. f.) Rech. f.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250090616' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Ziziphora</b> <b>clinopodioides</b> subsp. <b>pseudodasyantha</b>  (Rech. f) Rech. f.</A></ul>\n<p>\n<p>\n<B>Related Synonym(s):</B><br>\n<ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250090619' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Ziziphora</i> <i>afghanica</i>  Rech. f. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250090618' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Ziziphora</b> <b>clinopodioides</b> subsp. <b>afghanica</b>  (Rech. f.) Rech. f.</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=200020501' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Ziziphora</i> <i>pamiroalaica</i>  Juz. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250090616' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Ziziphora</b> <b>clinopodioides</b> subsp. <b>pseudodasyantha</b>  (Rech. f) Rech. f.</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250090617' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Ziziphora</i> <i>pseudodasyantha</i>  Rech. f. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250090616' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Ziziphora</b> <b>clinopodioides</b> subsp. <b>pseudodasyantha</b>  (Rech. f) Rech. f.</A></A></ul>\n<p>\n</span></P>\r\n                        <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                        <P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n                        <table id=\"tableObjectList\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"1\">\r\n\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <TABLE cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                                <TR>\r\n                                  <TD>\r\n                                    <span id=\"Label1\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n                                      <b>Related Objects</b>\r\n                                    </font></span></TD>\r\n                                  <TD align=\"